          "message": {
            "text": "Carry captured CSS text-rendering into the shared text renderer so DM-2623's WQY terminal correction owns only the measured auto state. Explicit author values retain the pre-existing shaping/rendering route instead of being silently overwritten by the Linux raster fix; the same field is passed at every ordinary, segmented, multiline, and input call site.",
            "markdown": "Carry captured CSS text-rendering into the shared text renderer so DM-2623's WQY terminal correction owns only the measured auto state. Explicit author values retain the pre-existing shaping/rendering route instead of being silently overwritten by the Linux raster fix; the same field is passed at every ordinary, segmented, multiline, and input call site."
          },
